        "text": {
            "description_html": "<b>Baldwin PD016-PRIV, Boulder Mortise Pocket Door Privacy Set</b>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nA privacy sliding pocket door pull like this one made by Baldwin features a thumbturn on the interior that throws and retracts the latch. Since it is just for privacy--normally used on bedroom and bathroom doors--it has an emergency release node on the exterior for easy unlocking in case of emergency. The Boulder Pocket Door Privacy Set has a lovely arched design that makes it a great choice for almost any home. It is for doors with a 2-1/2 inch backset that are at least 1.75 inches thick.\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Pocket Door Privacy Lock:</b> Locks but has access to unlock from the outside via emergency turn. Privacy locks do not offer security, they offer privacy.\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nAlso Available Matching: <a href=\"/products/boulder-pocket-door-passage-set-baldwin-pd016-pass\"><b>Passage Set</b></a> and <a href=\"/products/boulder-pocket-door-keyed-entry-baldwin-pd016-entr\"><b>Keyed Entry Function</b></a>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<table>\r\n<tr>\r\n<td class=\"text\">\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Specifications</b> of the Boulder Sliding Door Trim:\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Overall Width: 2.3\"</li>\r\n<li>Overall Height: 9.3\"</li>\r\n<li>Projection: .16\"</li>\r\n<li>Cup Width: 1.5\"</li>\r\n<li>Cup Height: 6.2\"</li>\r\n<li>Cup Depth: .24\"</li>\r\n<li>Minimum Door Thickness: 1.75\"</li>\r\n<li>Mortise Case Height: 6-9/16\"</li>\r\n<li>Mortise Case Width: 3/4\"</li>\r\n<li>Mortise Case Depth: 3-3/8\"</li>\r\n<li>Mortise Case Material: Steel</li>\r\n<li>Mortise Edge Face Height: 8\"</li>\r\n<li>Mortise Edge Face Width: 1\"</li>\r\n<li>Backset: 2-1/2\"</li>\r\n<li>Mortise Finger Pull: is thrown by pressing the button on the mortise faceplate. It can be retracted simply by pressing it flush with the faceplate.</li>\r\n<li><a href=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0766/1489/3857/files/baldwin-8602-template.pdf?v=1691094971\" target=\"new\"><b>Baldwin Mortise Lock Installation Template (PDF)</b></a></li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n</td>\r\n<td>\r\n<p>\r\n<img src=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0766/1489/3857/files/BAL-PD016-specifications.gif?v=1704354624\" width=\"243\" height=\"362\" border=\"0\" alt=\"Baldwin PD016 Specifications\">\r\n</p>\r\n</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n</table>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>*Sold as a Set:</b> two (2) arched flush pulls, a privacy mortise, and all mounting hardware. <b>For One (1) Door.</b>\r\n</p>",
            "seo": {
                "title": "Boulder Pocket Door Privacy Set, Baldwin PD016-PRIV",
                "description": "Baldwin PD016-PRIV, Boulder Pocket Door Privacy Set - A privacy sliding pocket door pull like this one made by Baldwin features a thumbturn on the interior that throws and retracts the latch. Since it is just for privacy--normally used on bedroom and bathroom doors--it has an emergency release node on the exterior for easy unlocking in case of emergency. The Boulder Pocket Door Privacy Set has a lovely arched design that makes it a great choice for almost any home. It is for doors with a 2-1/2 inch backset that are at least 1.75 inches thick.\r\n",
